17	 *   - it stashes the prompt in sessionStorage and pushes /signup (the auth
18	 *     wall). Here there is nothing to stash and nobody to sign up.
19	 *   - it renders a "get N free credits" rewards pill. The signed-in customer
20	 *     has a real balance, stated honestly below the box by CreditNote.
21	 *   - it probes /api/auth/me to decide whether to offer Enhance. Here the
