24	 *     this page opens the wizard IN PLACE and has no reference-image path.
25	 *
26	 * Importing it would mean adding props to another owner's file to switch all
27	 * of that off. So the parts the owner asked to keep — the glass treatment, the
28	 * two-layer rotating glow ring, and the Web Speech voice-to-text — are copied
29	 * verbatim below, comments included.
30	 *
31	 * ## The pair must stay recognisably identical
32	 *
33	 * If you change the glow geometry, the SPIN_SQUARE arithmetic, the composer's
34	 * border/shadow treatment, or the speech plumbing HERE, go and look at
35	 * components/marketing/PromptHero.tsx, and vice versa. They are two copies of
36	 * one design on purpose; they are not allowed to drift into two designs.
